#IOP-ILB#
# mxmc's exports: mcman's table (ps2sdk's XMCMAN, library mcman 2.3), the
# same entries at the same places, so MCSERV binds to it. The entries left
# out only return.
L mcman
V 0203
F 0000
E 000 _start
E 005 McDetectCard
E 006 McOpen
E 007 McClose
E 008 McRead
E 009 McWrite
E 010 McSeek
E 011 McFormat
E 012 McGetDir
E 013 McDelete
E 014 McFlush
E 015 McChDir
E 016 McSetFileInfo
E 017 McEraseBlock2
E 018 McReadPage
E 019 McWritePage
E 020 McDataChecksum
E 021 McDetectCard2
E 022 McGetFormat
E 023 McGetEntSpace
E 024 McReplaceBadBlock
E 025 McCloseAll
E 029 McReadPS1PDACard
E 030 McWritePS1PDACard
E 036 McUnformat
E 037 McRetOnly
E 038 McGetFreeClusters
E 039 McGetMcType
E 040 McSetPS1CardFlag
E 042 McGetModuleInfo
E 043 McGetCardSpec
E 044 McGetFATentry
E 045 McCheckBlock
E 046 McSetFATentry
E 047 McReadDirEntry
E 048 Mc1stCacheEntSetWrFlagOff
E 049 McCreateDirentry
E 050 McReadCluster
E 051 McFlushCache
E 052 McSetDirEntryState
